{"title":"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 10","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> is taken interior to a square with side-length <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and such that is it equally distant from two \nconsecutive vertices and from the side opposite these vertices. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> represents the common distance, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> equals:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/e/99e478764e718e50d722fceffa95929d2f464ed6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\frac{3a}{5}\\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ \\frac{5a}{8}\\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ \\frac{3a}{8}\\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\frac{a\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\frac{a}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"421\" height=\"41\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/9/509c25bf5568eacab3b98fb7cc86e0c1f5011a97.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] draw((0,0)--(16,0)--(16,16)--(0,16)--(0,0)); draw((0,0)--(8,6)); draw((16,0)--(8,6)); draw((8,16)--(8,6)); draw((8,0)--(8,6),dotted); label(&quot;$d$&quot;,(4,3),NW); label(&quot;$d$&quot;,(12,3),NE); label(&quot;$d$&quot;,(8,11),W); label(&quot;$\\frac{a}{2}$&quot;,(4,0),S); label(&quot;$\\frac{a}{2}$&quot;,(12,0),S); label(&quot;$a-d$&quot;,(8,2),W); [/asy]\" width=\"225\" height=\"252\" />\nDraw a diagram and label it as shown.  Because of SSS Congruency, the two bottom triangles are <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Right_triangle\" title=\"Right triangle\">right triangles</a>.  By the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Pythagorean_Theorem\" title=\"Pythagorean Theorem\">Pythagorean Theorem</a>,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/9/d195736d5ff3cb2ffec1396a29af354e90f67faf.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[d^2 = (a-d)^2 + (\\frac{a}{2})^2\\]\" width=\"159\" height=\"32\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/5/715fff45402cae2f7d6e57189e12b7b40e0a632e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[d^2 = a^2 - 2ad + d^2 + \\frac{a^2}{4}\\]\" width=\"189\" height=\"39\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/6/0a686135c8e5b3bd48abebc173c0a3d8e2c0cf45.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2ad = \\frac{5a^2}{4}\\]\" width=\"80\" height=\"39\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/f/32f9537c5a0abfd67fb80a4c25d234ddc749a819.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[d = \\frac{5a}{8}\\]\" width=\"54\" height=\"37\" />\nThus, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/1/a2194b81820e8380be586c1564c3f5d03d5c100d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"42\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME\" title=\"1963 AHSME\">1963 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1963 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1963\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">Problem 9</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1963 AHSM